BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 361.42 Tm (Have the complaint as near to finished as possible before approaching a former biller or co-worker, because a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 346.20 Tm (collaborator who refuses can turn around and file first [Brown, LLC - A Premier Whistleblower Law Firm -) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 330.97 Tm (3ugChIElhkM @ 00:04:54]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 315.75 Tm (Plead parallel state claims alongside the federal count; 29 states plus DC have FCAs and Medi-Cal is 50% federal) Tj ET
