BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (government exceeding $10 million in actual damages, measured pre-trebling, against a solvent defendant, but damages) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (and liability sit on a sliding scale, so a billion-dollar fraud can justify hard proof problems while a smaller case with a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (smoking-gun document can beat a giant case built on inference [Hb6Ogl9Fm8I @ 00:02:58]. The third filter is where) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (most cases die: facts versus theories. 'I think my company is defrauding Medicare' is a call; patient files, billing codes,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (dates, and the director's email ordering upcoding is a case, because Rule 9B particularity gets complaints dismissed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (every week [Hb6Ogl9Fm8I @ 00:04:15]. The remaining filters are character, geography, and program: the firm refuses) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (callers who are mean to intake staff or demand to speak only with Brown, weighs circuit splits and how aggressive) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (each United States Attorneys Office is, and concentrates on bounty programs. Stephen Teller's first move is simpler:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (have the insider describe exactly how the government is getting ripped off [SiATzxJHy2Y @ 00:04:16].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (Building the package is document-driven. Stephen Teller of Teller Law asks the insider to describe the fraud, then) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (gathers whatever paper or electronic records help explain it and drafts a couple of long letters plus a complaint that fits) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (the False Claims Act, all handed to the Department of Justice and filed under seal without serving the defendant) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm ([SiATzxJHy2Y @ 00:04:32]. Ron Chapman shows what the disclosure statement should carry using incident-to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (billing: a practice can bill 100 percent for a nurse practitioner or physician assistant who would normally draw 85) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (percent, but only if the physician is present in the office, so a biller who sees the doctor managing staff by telephone or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (text message has a scheme worth documenting [4cRTBx7ikiY @ 00:03:41]. The statement then gets built from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (calendars, billing records, medical records, and a list of people with intimate knowledge who might testify, because the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (US attorney uses it to decide whether to intervene [4cRTBx7ikiY @ 00:04:34]. Brown, LLC adds the construction) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (rules: build a timeline, separate what you know from what you suspect, identify who directed the conduct, preserve) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (lawful evidence already in your possession, and never destroy, alter, or hide anything or take privileged or unauthorized) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (documents [CZeUV80NaAA @ 00:07:40].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (Once filed, the clock is slow and the seal is the operating environment. Teller reports the seal typically runs 6 months at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (a time, with the government asking the judge for more, so cases stay sealed 8 months, 14 months, or a couple of years,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (and many Teller Law cases finish two or three years after filing; even the fast ones take almost a year [SiATzxJHy2Y) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (@ 00:08:23]. During that window the Department of Justice contacts the client agency, issues civil investigative) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (demands for documents, written answers, or depositions, and occasionally has relators wear recording devices) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm ([SiATzxJHy2Y @ 00:09:24]. At the end of the seal the government intervenes or declines; frequently it has already) Tj ET
