BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 186.65 Tm (the absolute worst thing you could do. Publicity also raises the odds that someone else files first and blocks the relator) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 171.43 Tm (in line. Brown frames the same clock bluntly: the first whistleblower to file generally blocks everyone behind them,) Tj ET
