BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Detail: Whistleblowers need to file a Form TCR and strictly follow the CFTC's filing procedures, because mistakes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (lead to denial of the reward [Whistleblowers International - nGZvKSKSh-Y @ 00:02:08]. Privileged material is held) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (back until a taint process exists [Fraud in America - R3h4J-EAtro @ 00:31:26].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (Step: 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Title: Cooperate, keep the award office informed, then claim) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (Action: Assist every agency that picks up the tip, keep the award office informed of each contact, and file the award) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (submission after the enforcement action.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (Detail: After an enforcement action, the whistleblower submits an award claim to FinCEN, which manages the award) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (even when OFAC or other agencies ran the case, so the tipster keeps FinCEN informed of every contact [Fraud in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (America - R3h4J-EAtro @ 00:22:24].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (Timing is where the money is won or lost, and the clocks are specific. Weiner walks through the SEC carve-out for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (compliance officers. People whose principal duties are compliance or internal audit are normally excluded from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (awards. Once 120 days have passed since a supervisor, the chief compliance officer, the chief legal officer or the audit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (committee received the information, they are free to go to the SEC and stay bounty-eligible [7vp44tFe6hs @ 00:23:52].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (A second clock protects internal reporters. If an employee reports through company channels and contacts the SEC) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (within 120 days, the SEC credits the employee when the company later hands over the same information or its) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (investigation results [7vp44tFe6hs @ 00:25:13]. Weiner also reports what the plaintiff side actually tells clients. On a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (substantial issue, most whistleblower attorneys would not advise reporting to the company first, though some advise) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (reporting internally and to the SEC at the same time [7vp44tFe6hs @ 00:27:50]. The retaliation clocks run differently.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (Sarbanes-Oxley gives only 180 days from the retaliation to file. Dodd-Frank allows up to six years and potentially) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (double damages, but only if the report went directly to the SEC [ft81gWsFd2M @ 00:01:32].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (The money-laundering lane has been rebuilt from scratch. Mahany notes that the old Bank Secrecy Act rewards were) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (capped at $150,000 and were completely discretionary, which is why very few AML rewards were ever paid) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm ([BueLAsaxhHM @ 00:00:40]. Eckard lays out the fix. The Anti-Money Laundering Whistleblower Improvement Act,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (signed December 23, 2022, sets a 10 percent minimum award. It extends coverage to sanctions violations under) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (IEEPA, the Trading with the Enemy Act and the Kingpin Act. It also expressly lets compliance and audit staff and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (non-US citizens collect [tLBsvqESK6o @ 00:01:15]. Poppy Alexander describes how FinCEN routes tips. They arrive) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (by email or online form and get farmed out to OFAC for sanctions, to the OCC and Federal Reserve for bank issues,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (and to DOJ. FinCEN's whistleblower office still controls the award, so the tipster must keep FinCEN informed of every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (conversation with OFAC or anyone else [R3h4J-EAtro @ 00:21:08]. Andrew Feller adds the speed lever. FinCEN) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (proposed a presumption of the maximum 30 percent award with a $15 million threshold, against $5 million at the SEC.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (The CFTC estimated that roughly 80 percent of its historic awards would have qualified under its own similar proposal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm ([R3h4J-EAtro @ 00:12:18].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (The newest bounty lanes stack on top. Matt Kelly explains that the DOJ Criminal Division pilot pays up to 30 percent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (of net proceeds after asset forfeiture. In his example, a $300 million settlement with $100 million going to victim) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (restitution leaves the tipster's 30 percent calculated on the remaining $200 million [bFRmUwE-_F4 @ 00:01:27]. Tom) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.90 Tm (Fox flags the tiers: 30 percent of the first $100 million, 5 percent of anything between $100 million and $500 million,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 145.67 Tm (and nothing clear above that. The pilot is scheduled to run three years [bFRmUwE-_F4 @ 00:18:25]. Kelly also names) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.45 Tm (the targets: FEPA bribery of foreign officials, FCPA cases at non-public companies outside SEC reach, and health care) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.22 Tm (fraud. These are the gaps where no awards program existed before [bFRmUwE-_F4 @ 00:02:07]. At the retail end,) Tj ET
